{"availability":"available","full":"macro-inc/macro","name":"macro","description":"Macro is a unified workspace for teams: email, chat, docs, tasks, agents, calls, and CRM — @-linked together with shared AI memory.","category":"Business","language":"Rust","stars":4544,"forks":440,"created":"2025-11-08T15:18:27Z","updated":"2026-10-04T07:56:51Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://macro.com","topics":["agent","ai","ai-agents","all-in-one","crm","crm-system","email","linear","mcp","messaging","notes","notion","office","rust","slack","slack-alternative","startup","startup-tools","typescript","workspace"],"demo":"https://cal.com/team/macro/macro-demo-call?metadata%5Bfbp%5D=fb.1.1778954074516.817396687896036613","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:12.200Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:12.200Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:12.200Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:10.517Z","stars":4542,"forks":440},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:18:12.200Z","stars":4544,"forks":440}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Macro is the all-in-one workspace for you and your team. It unifies email + messages + docs + tasks + agents + CRM into a single fast interface with shared team-level memory. Everything in your workspace is @linked and searchable so your team (and your agents) never have to switch tools.","We built Macro because we wanted a single operating system for our startup. There are many good software products, and we used them all — Slack, Linear, Notion, HubSpot, and Superhuman — but they don't work together as one system. As we scaled our last venture to 20 people things started to break: every team got their own tools and the company was held together by MCP and Zapier. The company was not computable. It was chaotic.","Macro is a complete redesign of work software from the ground up as a single system."],"features":["Macro is composed of 'blocks' designed to be modular, extensible, and work together like Lego. For each block, we studied the best prior art and tried to make it even better.","Each surface is purpose-built for its job rather than composed from a generic block primitive — but every one of them shares the same backend; cross-references between a doc and a task, or a channel message and an…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/macro-inc/macro/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d166e5f9715deb1a175f318f3d8f7429e9a105c131a3575f820d19b6f409a355","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:10.628Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:12.326Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Macro is the all-in-one workspace for you and your team. It unifies email + messages + docs + tasks + agents + CRM into a single fast interface with shared team-level memory. Everything in your workspace is @linked and searchable so your team (and your agents) never have to switch tools.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/macro-inc/macro/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Each surface is purpose-built for its job rather than composed from a generic block primitive — but every one of them shares the same backend; cross-references between a doc and a task, or a channel message and an…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/macro-inc/macro/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign up and connect your Gmail or Google Workspace account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/macro-inc/macro/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d166e5f9715deb1a175f318f3d8f7429e9a105c131a3575f820d19b6f409a355","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/macro-inc/macro/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:12.326Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T07:56:51Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/macro-inc/macro/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T11:35:17.420Z","hash":"d166e5f9715deb1a175f318f3d8f7429e9a105c131a3575f820d19b6f409a355","originalBytes":20024,"storedBytes":20024,"truncated